  "description": {
   "en": "In the grand empire of Tygen, Robellia's serene life takes a dark turn, catapulting her into a saga of vengeance. In a world of power and intrigue, she exposes hidden truths, navigating a tumultuous path between hero and villain. Armed with extraordinary magic, Robellia is steadfast in unveiling the obscured secrets of the empire and recovering her lost happiness.\n\n---\nRobellia isn't so foolish as to believe in a happy life. She was robbed of such flowery optimism the day her husband betrayed her and her child was lost. Now, armed with the power to exact revenge on those who scorned her, she's determined to expose the lies and deceit behind the empire she calls her home. But can she come out the other side as a redeemable person once all is said and done?"
  },
